<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN CLINCHES THIRD WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN CLINCHES THIRD WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MONTMELO, Spain 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Doohan of Australia clinched his third successive 500cc world championship when he finished second in the Grand Prix of Catalonia on Sunday.</p>
</text>
